        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "description": "Something the record points at rather than describes.\n\nBlue Core keeps a referenced resource's description in its own row, so what\nremains here is usually just a URI -- 5,245 of 8,875 node values in a\n200-record sample. `label` is present when the record happens to carry one.",
